-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §51 תנאי ההעסקה של מורים קיימים שאינם
-- אקדמאים: a non-academic teacher in a reform school with 1 to 27 years of
-- seniority for pay is asked to undertake (annex ח') to complete a degree
-- within 4 years — signed, he is under the reform's non-academic terms and
-- §§59–60; unsigned, on the existing terms; one with 28 years or more is
-- not asked, is under the non-academic terms, and §§59(א) and 60 apply if
-- he completes a degree within 4 years (later, by part מט). The seniority
-- is the one on the school's move.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `51 תנאי ההעסקה של מורים קיימים שאינם אקדמאים`

DECLARE `non-academic's terms` IS ONE OF
    `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59–60`
    `the existing terms, off the reform`
    `the reform's non-academic terms`
    `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59(א) and 60`
    `the reform's non-academic terms, §§59(א) and 60 for the committees of part מט`
    `none under section 51`

-- (א)–(ב): by the seniority for pay on the day the school moved ((ג)), the
-- rules of seniority being those of the eve of the signing.
@ref akn:art_51__para_a akn:art_51__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_51__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_51__para_b akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_51__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_51__para_c
GIVEN `seniority on the school's move` IS A NUMBER
      `signed the undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
      `years from the school's move to the degree` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `non-academic's terms`
DECIDE `the non-academic's terms` `seniority on the school's move` `signed the undertaking` `years from the school's move to the degree` IS
    IF `seniority on the school's move` AT LEAST 28
    THEN CONSIDER `years from the school's move to the degree`
         WHEN JUST y THEN IF y AT MOST 4 THEN `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59(א) and 60`
                          ELSE `the reform's non-academic terms, §§59(א) and 60 for the committees of part מט`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `the reform's non-academic terms`
    ELSE IF `seniority on the school's move` AT LEAST 1
         THEN IF `signed the undertaking` THEN `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59–60` ELSE `the existing terms, off the reform`
         ELSE `none under section 51`

`years to complete the degree` MEANS 4

#ASSERT `the non-academic's terms` 27 FALSE NOTHING EQUALS `the existing terms, off the reform`
#ASSERT `the non-academic's terms` 28 FALSE NOTHING EQUALS `the reform's non-academic terms`
#ASSERT `the non-academic's terms` 30 FALSE (JUST 3) EQUALS `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59(א) and 60`
#ASSERT `the non-academic's terms` 12 TRUE NOTHING EQUALS `the reform's non-academic terms, with §§59–60`
